DEBUG:root:Ollama raw response: model='llama3' created_at='2025-03-11T06:59:56.8035695Z' done=True done_reason='stop' total_duration=203506351000 load_duration=6865053300 prompt_eval_count=178 prompt_eval_duration=11914000000 eval_count=738 eval_duration=184724000000 response='Here are the comprehensive test scenarios for adding items to the cart:\n\n### Module: Cart Management\n\n- **Test Scenario:** Adding a single item to the cart\n  - **Test Case ID:** TC-CART-001 \n  - **Priority:** P1 (High)\n  - **Preconditions:** User is logged in, and the product catalog is accessible.\n  - **Test Steps:**\n    1. Navigate to the product catalog page.\n    2. Select a single item from the catalog and click "Add to Cart".\n    3. Verify that the item is added to the cart and the quantity is set to 1.\n\n  - **Expected Results:** The item should be successfully added to the cart, and the quantity should be set to 1.\n  - **Security Impact:** Low\n  - **Edge Cases Covered:**\n    - Edge case 1: Adding an item that is not in stock.\n      - Verify that the system prevents adding items that are out of stock.\n    - Edge case 2: Adding an item with a maximum quantity limit.\n      - Verify that the system enforces the maximum quantity limit.\n\n- **Test Scenario:** Adding multiple items to the cart\n  - **Test Case ID:** TC-CART-002 \n  - **Priority:** P1 (High)\n  - **Preconditions:** User is logged in, and the product catalog is accessible.\n  - **Test Steps:**\n    1. Navigate to the product catalog page.\n    2. Select multiple items from the catalog and click "Add to Cart".\n    3. Verify that all selected items are added to the cart.\n\n  - **Expected Results:** All selected items should be successfully added to the cart.\n  - **Security Impact:** Low\n  - **Edge Cases Covered:**\n    - Edge case 1: Adding multiple items with a maximum quantity limit.\n      - Verify that the system enforces the maximum quantity limit for each item.\n\n- **Test Scenario:** Updating the quantity of an item in the cart\n  - **Test Case ID:** TC-CART-003 \n  - **Priority:** P2 (Medium)\n  - **Preconditions:** User is logged in, and the product catalog is accessible.\n  - **Test Steps:**\n    1. Navigate to the cart page.\n    2. Select an item from the cart and update the quantity.\n    3. Verify that the updated quantity is reflected in the cart.\n\n  - **Expected Results:** The updated quantity should be successfully saved in the cart.\n  - **Security Impact:** Low\n  - **Edge Cases Covered:**\n    - Edge case 1: Updating the quantity of an item to a value greater than its maximum limit.\n      - Verify that the system prevents updating the quantity beyond the maximum limit.\n\n- **Test Scenario:** Removing an item from the cart\n  - **Test Case ID:** TC-CART-004 \n  - **Priority:** P2 (Medium)\n  - **Preconditions:** User is logged in, and the product catalog is accessible.\n  - **Test Steps:**\n    1. Navigate to the cart page.\n    2. Select an item from the cart and click "Remove".\n    3. Verify that the item is successfully removed from the cart.\n\n  - **Expected Results:** The item should be successfully removed from the cart.\n  - **Security Impact:** Low\n  - **Edge Cases Covered:**\n    - Edge case 1: Removing an item with a minimum quantity limit.\n      - Verify that the system prevents removing items below the minimum quantity limit.' context=[128006, 882, 128007, 1432, 262, 3146, 9207, 96618, 19903, 67008, 29483, 58394, 304, 4868, 323, 8907, 7649, 198, 262, 3146, 6396, 96618, 20400, 16195, 1296, 26350, 369, 279, 2728, 16686, 382, 262, 3146, 76902, 12051, 334, 512, 262, 2724, 1288, 387, 3025, 311, 923, 3673, 311, 279, 7558, 382, 262, 3146, 5207, 15392, 334, 512, 262, 55375, 61173, 198, 262, 17010, 14026, 25, 510, 3413, 4076, 933, 262, 482, 3146, 2323, 59763, 96618, 510, 55131, 7817, 933, 415, 482, 3146, 2323, 11799, 3110, 96618, 25610, 42095, 6277, 60, 720, 415, 482, 3146, 21197, 96618, 393, 15, 320, 43108, 5738, 47, 16, 320, 12243, 5738,